      //     card is only READ (no coil, no servo, no ring start; every pci1203.*
      //     command answers DRY RUN).
      //   * every machine file goes through a seam to a COPY in ../runcfg or
      //     ../machines (IOWEB-P11 + the tree's existing seams). The copies carry
      //     IO_CARD_TYPE=4 and the field IO_Table/Mot_Table (Lane 1, remapped axes).
