      // ⚠⚠ AI(W906-ZEROARG) 20260918: NO ARGUMENTS. That is the whole point.
      //   User ruling: 「我不要任何參數且全部都要執行」「軟體模擬僅有開啟
      //   SOFT_SIMULTE，否則就是機台上能跑，就這兩種」。
      //   What this binary can do is a BUILD-time fact (SOFT_SIMULTE), not a
      //   runtime flag combination -- same shape as the BCB6 HT9045.exe.
      //   ⇒ Reads and writes hit the REAL machine files. The protection is
      //     BACKUP -> VERIFY -> DELETE BACKUP, not a flag. wb_serve says so
      //     unconditionally in its own startup banner.
      //   ⚠ f5_contract_probe.cjs asserts this array is EMPTY. Adding a flag
